d for audience fit and editorial quality, never link farm submissions dressed as guest posts."}]]}],["$","$L12","4",{"className":"inc-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inc-num","children":"05"}],["$","h4",null,{"children":"Linkable asset creation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Tools, calculators, original research and infographics that earn organic backlinks because other sites genuinely want to reference them."}]]}],["$","$L12","5",{"className":"inc-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inc-num","children":"06"}],["$","h4",null,{"children":"Content performance reporting"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Monthly reporting on content rankings, organic traffic, link acquisitions and domain authority movement — showing the compounding effect of content and link work over time."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
